n><span class=\"on\"></span><span></span><span></span></div></td>\n              <td><span class=\"tag\">検討</span></td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card-sm anim d3\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; border-color: var(--green-soft);\">\n        <span style=\"color: var(--green); font-weight: 600;\">川上の推奨：</span>\n        <span style=\"color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 13px;\">まず <strong style=\"color: var(--fg);\">「ひと言ログ」</strong> で最速MVP検証 → 次に競合がほぼゼロの <strong style=\"color: var(--fg);\">「フォーカス for ADHD」</strong>。前者は開発コストが低く素早く検証でき、後者は日本語市場でほぼ独占できる希少なチャンス。</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ── 9: Next Steps ── -->\n  <div class=\"slide\">\n    <div class=\"full\" style=\"max-width: 860px;\">\n      <div class=\"mono-label anim\">Next Steps</div>\n      <h2 class=\"anim d1\">どう進める<span class=\"accent-text\">か</span></h2>\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"margin-top: 28px; align-items: flex-start;\">\n        <div class=\"col anim d2\">\n          <div class=\"card\" style=\"height: 100%;\">\n            <h3 style=\"color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 14px;\">フェーズ 1 — 検証（〜1ヶ月）</h3>\n            <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;\">\n              <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start;\">\n                <div style=\"width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent-soft); border: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); flex-shrink: 0;\">1</div>\n                <div><div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;\">アイデアを1つ決定</div><div style=\"font-size: 11px; color: var(--fg-muted); margin-top: 2px;\">山下さんがピンとくる1案に絞る</div></div>\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start;\">\n                <div style=\"width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent-soft); border: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); flex-shrink: 0;\">2</div>\n                <div><div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;\">LP + 事前登録フォーム作成</div><div style=\"font-size: 11px; color: var(--fg-muted); margin-top: 2px;\">Vercel + Next.jsで即日デプロイ、SNSで告知</div></div>\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start;\">\n                <div style=\"width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent-soft); border: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); flex-shrink: 0;\">3</div>\n                <div><div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;\">登録者数で需要を確認</div><div style=\"font-size: 11px; color: var(--fg-muted); margin-top: 2px;\">50人超えたら開発GO</div></div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col anim d3\">\n          <div class=\"card\" style=\"height: 100%;\">\n            <h3 style=\"color: var(--green); margin-bottom: 14px;\">フェーズ 2 — MVP開発（〜3ヶ月）</h3>\n            <ul class=\"feature-list\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n              <li>川上がNext.js + Claude API でMVPをスクラッチ開発</li>\n              <li>コア機能のみ、デザインはシンプルに</li>\n              <li>Vercelで即デプロイ、テストユーザーに触ってもらう</li>\n              <li>フィードバックをもとに2週間スプリントで改善</li>\n            </ul>\n            <div class=\"card-sm\" style=\"border-color: var(--green-soft);\">\n              <div style=\"font-size: 11px; color: var(--green); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px;\">技術スタック案</div>\n              <div style=\"font-size: 11px; color: var(--fg-muted); line-height: 1.8;\">\n                Next.js 15 + TypeScript<br>\n                Claude API（感情分析 / AI会話）<br>\n                Supabase（DB + 認証）<br>\n                Stripe（サブスク課金）<br>\n                Vercel（デプロイ）\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card-sm anim d4\" style=\"margin-top: 16px; text-align: center; border-color: var(--accent-soft);\">\n        <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: var(--fg-muted);\">次のステップ：</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: var(--fg); font-weight: 600;\">この資料をもとに山下さんに1案を決めてもらう → 川上がLP作成・開発着手</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div><!-- /deck -->\n\n<div id=\"nav\">\n  <button onclick=\"prev()\">←</button>\n  <div class=\"dot-row\" id=\"dots\"></div>\n  <span id=\"counter\">1 / 1</span>\n  <button onclick=\"next()\">→</button>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  const slides = document.querySelectorAll('.slide');\n  let cur = 0;\n  const dotsEl = document.getElementById('dots');\n  const counterEl = document.getElementById('counter');\n  slides.forEach((_, i) => {\n    const d = document.createElement('div');\n    d.className = 'dot' + (i === 0 ? ' active' : '');\n    d.onclick = () => go(i);\n    dotsEl.appendChild(d);\n  });\n  counterEl.textContent = '1 / ' + slides.length;\n  // activate first slide (it has class active in HTML for initial render)\n  slides[0].classList.add('active');\n  function go(n) {\n    slides[cur].classList.remove('active');\n    dotsEl.children[cur].classList.remove('active');\n    cur = (n + slides.length) % slides.length;\n    slides[cur].classList.add('active');\n    dotsEl.children[cur].classList.add('active');\n    counterEl.textContent = (cur + 1) + ' / ' + slides.length;\n  }\n  function next() { go(cur + 1); }\n  function prev() { go(cur - 1); }\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', e => {\n    if (e.key === 'ArrowRight' || e.key === ' ') { e.preventDefault(); next(); }\n    if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft') { e.preventDefault(); prev(); }\n  });\n  let ts = 0;\n  document.addEventListener('touchstart', e => { ts = e.touches[0].clientX; });\n  document.addEventListener('touchend', e => {\n    const dx = e.changedTouches[0].clientX - ts;\n    if (Math.abs(dx) > 50) dx < 0 ? next() : prev();\n  });\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}